DEBT        price → $2,400 (your token, wk 3): settled null at E3 (1/6 vs 4/7)
OPTIONS     Persevere p .18 · PIVOT post-award reporting (E4: 2 paid pilots) · Shelve (trigger ≥5 inbound) · Wind-down
